            "review_title": "Review at Green Monkey Saigon",
            "review_text": "Pippa Jones\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam71 contributions\n0\n10/10!\nApr 2026 • Friends\nThe food here is 10/10! \nLots of flavour, quality products and fresh ingredients. \nChilled calm vibes, the staff were very friendly and welcoming. Nothing too ott. \nReally good options for vegetarians/vegans too. A few complementary veggie starters, which were very tasty. \nMyself and my friends went here for brunch, all having a baguette which was freshly baked and crusty. The coffee was great and had dairy free milk for them. \nPricing was of course on the higher side, but is expected for a more western style food and the location of Thao Dien. \nWould 100% recommend!\nRead more\nWritten April 22, 2026",
