            "review_text": "Mithun Patil\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nYour Go To Spot for Fresh healthy food and Calm Vibes\nFeb 2026 • Solo\nIf you appreciate clean ingredients, creative combinations, and a peaceful café vibe, Green Monkey is a small gem in Saigon that absolutely deserves a visit.\n\nThe team is warm, attentive, and genuinely welcoming. Whether you’re stopping by for a relaxed brunch, a solo coffee with your laptop, or a casual catch-up with friends, the space just works.\n\nWhat really stands out is the food philosophy. Everything tastes fresh, thoughtfully made.\nRead more\nWritten February 5, 2026",
