            "review_text": "Luka Mami\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nQuiet hidden place that has best sandwiches in Saigon!\nJul 2024 • Solo\nGreat hidden spot, quiet and only a few seats which I liked, other than that I really liked their sandwich menu. Everything is dairy free so really suitable for people with dairy allergies. I had the Tuna Salad pita bread and it was great! They also have great vegan desserts! Will definitely be back.\nWritten September 3, 2024\nVukasin K\nLuka M., you’ve uncovered our little secret!🤫✨ We’re so glad you enjoyed the peaceful vibe and our cozy few seats—it’s all part of the charm. Thrilled the Tuna Salad pita hit the spot (and that our dairy-free focus works for you!). And yes, those vegan desserts? Can’t wait to serve you another delicious sandwich or sweet treat next time—thanks for spreading the word!\" \n\nWarmly,\nVuko\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
