            "review_text": "Marco G\n4 contributions\n0\nTropical Twist for Cozy workspace\nAug 2024 • Solo\nGood spot to work on Laptop, it has only few tables therefore its never crowded. I had an amazing whole wheat sandwich with mango, sundried tomatoes and prosciutto; such a tropical twist to Italian classic. Polite staff, hibiscus iced tea is free as welcome drink.\nInsider tip:\nbest time to visit is for brinner actually; dinner time for breakfast food :)\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 19, 2024\nVukasin K\nWow, your review just made our day!🌿✨ We pour so much love into crafting a peaceful escape and fresh, flavorful dishes—so hearing that you loved the overnight oats and smoked salmon baguette (a dream combo, right?) means everything. Thrilled our little spot could be your calm in the chaos, and even happier you noticed the dairy-free care we take. Can’t wait to serve you another ‘fantastic’ bite or two soon—you’re always welcome here!\" \n\nWith gratitude,\nVuko\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
