            "review_text": "EdiNY\n5 contributions\n0\nHidden Dairy Free Spot In Ho Chi Minh City\nJul 2024 • Couples\nThe calm atmosphere is the ideal way to get away from the rush. Place is small, very intimate, AC is working well for heat escape. The cuisine is handmade, fresh, and really flavorful. It is just fantastic. You're in for a treat whether you visit us frequently or not. All food is Dairy-Free. I had overnight oats and smoked salmon baguette; both were amazing. Strongly advised!\"\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 10, 2024\nVukasin K\nDear Edi,\n\nThank you so much for your wonderful review! We’re thrilled to hear you enjoyed the calm atmosphere, handmade cuisine, and dairy-free offerings—it’s exactly the experience we aim to create for our guests. The overnight oats and smoked salmon baguette are some of our favorites too! We truly appreciate your recommendation and can’t wait to welcome you back for another fantastic visit. \n\nWarm regards,\nVuko\nRead more\nWritten June 6, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
